# pnpm 11 reads ONLY auth/registry settings from .npmrc. The former non-auth
# settings (public-hoist-pattern for @stryker-mutator/*, save-prefix="") moved to
# pnpm-workspace.yaml as publicHoistPattern + savePrefix (ADR-0019). This file is
# intentionally kept (empty of non-auth config) as the home for future auth/registry
# entries only.
